0", "status": "ok", "posts": []}, {"team": "okc", "query": "\"OKC Thunder\"", "hour": "2026-10-26T09:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": []}, {"team": "okc", "query": "\"OKC Thunder\"", "hour": "2026-10-26T10:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": []}, {"team": "okc", "query": "\"OKC Thunder\"", "hour": "2026-10-26T11:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:4othh5tkxlwdrfzxttnckjgb/app.bsky.feed.post/3myrn32p4gc2x", "author_did": "did:plc:4othh5tkxlwdrfzxttnckjgb", "handle": "hoopspitch.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-26T11:37:42.597Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-26T11:37:43.139Z", "text": "Tonight:  Defending champs OKC Thunder (3-0, SGA scored 34 vs the Clippers) host the Phoenix Suns. Booker just dropped 43 on the Warriors - can the champs stay perfect, or does Booker spoil it? My pick: Thunder 118, Suns 111."}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:hmizoisby3jvhh3iysn76o4o/app.bsky.feed.post/3myrlfclpml2i", "author_did": "did:plc:hmizoisby3jvhh3iysn76o4o", "handle": "the-sun.com", "created_at": "2026-10-26T11:07:38.694Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-26T11:07:39.837Z", "text": "OKC Thunder star carted off on stretcher with gruesome injury"}]}, {"team": "okc", "query": "\"OKC Thunder\"", "hour": "2026-10-26T12:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:qi4xfiypxoxnpn2xy2mwuqwu/app.bsky.feed.post/3myrq5jg2fs2b", "author_did": "did:plc:qi4xfiypxoxnpn2xy2mwuqwu", "handle": "philipselmann.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-26T12:32:46.363Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-26T12:32:49.047Z", "text": "Del 2 af analysen af Northwest Division er ude. Jeg er meget varm p\u00e5 OKC Thunder, som jeg udr\u00e5ber til titelfavorit pga pr\u00e6stationerne i de f\u00f8rste par kampe. Jalen Williams\u2019 skade havde nedtonet min entusiasme gevaldigt, men giv det et lyt #NBASky"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:qi4xfiypxoxnpn2xy2mwuqwu/app.bsky.feed.post/3myrpx5yawk2b", "author_did": "did:plc:qi4xfiypxoxnpn2xy2mwuqwu", "handle": "philipselmann.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-26T12:29:13.048Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-26T12:29:13.351Z", "text": "Stjernespilleren Jalen Williams kom slemt til skade i nat, og det lignede meget et uheld a la Gordon Haywards. OKC Thunder klarede sig uden Williams i forrige s\u00e6son og skal nok g\u00f8re det igen, men med ham ude - formentlig for s\u00e6sonen - er holdet gevaldigt sv\u00e6kket i titelkampen #NBASky"}]}, {"team": "okc", "query": "\"OKC Thunder\"", "hour": "2026-10-26T13:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": []}, {"team": "okc", "query": "\"OKC Thunder\"", "hour": "2026-10-26T14:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:fjyz6vi5ih6fktq7rzkaiacb/app.bsky.feed.post/3myrwppcskm24", "author_did": "did:plc:fjyz6vi5ih6fktq7rzkaiacb", "handle": "x-minus-t.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-26T14:30:18.939Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-26T14:30:19.136Z", "text": "Player grades: Jalen Williams' injury shadows Thunder's 108-101 win over Clippers - OKC Thunder Wire\n\n#News #USAToday"}]}, {"team": "okc", "query": "\"OKC Thunder\"", "hour": "2026-10-26T15:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:olmedmssj6wvrpvekb72bstb/app.bsky.feed.post/3mys3jizjvbl2", "author_did": "did:plc:olmedmssj6wvrpvekb72bstb", "handle": "tmz.com.web.brid.gy", "created_at": "2026-10-26T15:56:19.743Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-26T15:56:23.148Z", "text": ""}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:bhci7om25qb6ae63dgccrbyw/app.bsky.feed.post/3mys3aemtz22u", "author_did": "did:plc:bhci7om25qb6ae63dgccrbyw", "handle": "grimaldi.tv", "created_at": "2026-10-26T15:51:12.180414+00:00", "indexed_at": "2026-10-26T15:51:13.942Z", "text": "Jalen Williams suffers a gruesome ankle injury with seconds left in Sunday's game. His OKC Thunder teammates struggled to keep it together, with Shai Gilgeous-Alexander fighting back tears. https://www.tmz.com/2026/10/26/jalen-williams-suffers-gruesome-ankle-injury"}]}, {"team": "okc", "query": "\"OKC Thunder\"", "hour": "2026-10-26T16:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"